// Where Xcode reads the Apple Team ID (kosmos #4089, #718, #6262). tools/archive.sh also holds the
// same Team ID, as the only team it allows io.kosmos.app under: a team change edits both files.
//
// The Xcode project reads it from here (this file is the app target's base configuration), and
// tools/archive.sh reads it from here for the export.
//
// 6563JLN5HF is Kosmos Agent Manager, Inc. (#6262), the team io.kosmos.app is registered under, with
// Push Notifications on. It replaces the interim Stone Syndicate preview app (#4089), which was never
// created in App Store Connect. tools/archive.sh builds io.kosmos.app under this team and no other.
// Push needs an APNs key from the SAME team as this one (docs/phone-push-go-live.md, Step 1).
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = 6563JLN5HF

// The bundle id the app is built with (the project reads PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER from here, and
// tools/archive.sh checks the exported app against it).
KOSMOS_BUNDLE_ID = io.kosmos.app
